  "description": "SteadyFlow.Resilience is a lightweight resilience toolkit for .NET, designed with modern async-first patterns.\n\t\t  It provides retry policies with exponential backoff, circuit breaker protection, flexible rate limiting\n\t\t  (Token Bucket and Sliding Window), batch processing, and fluent chaining for building resilience pipelines.\n\t\t  Includes ASP.NET Core middleware integration and is fully covered by tests (100% coverage).",
